<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1612_5853.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Hochgeachter edler und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolgebornner</unclear> gnediger herr, e. G.
<lb n="2"/>seyen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">beraiten</unclear> willige dienst, mit aller <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ehrerpietung</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuvor</unclear>, gnediger herr.
<lb n="4"/>Dieweil e. G. beliebt <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>, daß wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> portion
<lb n="5"/>deß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yez</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ußthailenden</unclear> gelts, mit und nebend <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear>
<lb n="6"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> lieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eidtgnossen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nachparen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-8" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Appenzell</unclear></placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuoerheben</unclear>,
<lb n="7"/>habend wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßern</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lieben</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">getrüwen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stattschreiber</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darzuo</unclear> verordnet. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Hienebend</unclear> aber nit underlassen
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear>, e. G. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dienstfleissig</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuoberichten</unclear>, daß
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vorfar</unclear> und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geweßner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ambassador</unclear>, der herr von
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Vic</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vor</unclear> disem die vertröstung geben und versprochen,
<lb n="12"/>wann die 70000 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kronen</unclear>, darfür die fünff <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stett</unclear>
<lb n="13"/>(under denen wir auch begriffen) <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bürgen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geweßen</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/>abgelegt seyen. Daß alßdann ein anfang ge-
<lb n="15"/>macht, und volgends <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">continuiert</unclear> werden, damit
<lb n="16"/>dardurch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußstehend</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hauptguot</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kr</unclear>. 20000
<lb n="17"/>auch abgelößt und wider erstattet werden <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">solle</unclear>.
<lb n="18"/>Und dieweil dann die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angeregten</unclear> 70000 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kr</unclear>. nun-
<lb n="19"/>mehr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">abgericht</unclear> worden. So <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bitten</unclear> wir e. G.
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienstfleissig</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dero</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welle</unclear> gnedig belieben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lassen</unclear>,
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> an dem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hauptguot</unclear>, beneben den zinßen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">und</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pensionen</unclear> ein <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ansehe</unclear>-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">summa</unclear> widerfaren <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuolassen</unclear>. Und ansehen, daß nit
<lb n="23"/>allain diß gelt vil lange jar über den <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">versprochnen</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>termin <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ußgestanden</unclear>; <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">sonderen</unclear> auch wir mit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">den</unclear> ob-
<lb n="25"/>angeregten 70000 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kronen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßer</unclear> bestes auch gethan,
<lb n="26"/>daß wir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hoffend</unclear> gegen e. G. in disem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear>
<lb n="27"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begeren</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">des</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwes</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuognoßen</unclear>. Wo
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">danne</unclear> e. G. wir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alle</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beliebten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dienst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erzaigung</unclear>
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">köinen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewißen</unclear>, daß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wellen</unclear> wir nit ersparen.
<lb n="30"/>Dat. den <origDate when="1608-08-14" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">14</unclear>. augusti ao 1608</origDate>.
<lb n="31"/>E. G.
<lb n="32"/>dienstwillige
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">B</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">u</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rhat</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">statt</unclear>
<lb n="34"/><origPlace ref="stadtasg-places-38" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">SantGallen</unclear></origPlace>.
<lb n="35"/>Dem hochgeachten edlen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wolgebornnen</unclear>
<lb n="36"/>herren, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">herren</unclear> von <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Refüge</unclear>, k. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Mt</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuo</unclear> <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-131" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Franckreich</unclear></placeName>
<lb n="37"/>und <placeName resp="#ner">Navarren</placeName> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehaimen</unclear> rhat, und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ambassadorn</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">einer</unclear> loblichen <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Eidtgnoschafft</unclear></orgName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unßerm</unclear> gnedigen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">herren</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1612_5854.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">An</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frantzöß</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">her</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ambassadorn</unclear> <origDate when="1605-08-22" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">22</unclear>. Augusti
<lb n="40"/>1605</origDate>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gelt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhebung</unclear>
</p>
